  "goodToKnow": "Die Privatisierung is privatisation. After reunification, the Treuhandanstalt privatised or closed around 8,500 East German state companies, leading to mass unemployment and lasting resentment in the east. Deutsche Post and Telekom were privatised in the 1990s, and Deutsche Bahn became a state-owned company. The opposite is die Verstaatlichung (nationalisation). Plural: die Privatisierungen."
